    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "detection , mitigation , and closure events - Root cause analysis : concise causal chain ( not a laundry list ) with evidence links ( logs , dashboards , traces ) - Mitigations applied during the incident ( with timestamps and owners ) - Long-term corrective actions : 90-day plan with owner and target completion date ( format : ACTION — OWNER — ETA ) - Verification plan : how we will validate the fix ( synthetic tests , load tests , monitoring checks ) - Lessons learned / Preventative measures : short list , prioritized - Postmortem checklist and artifacts : list of evidence files retained and retention policy - Distribution list and stakeholder notifications : who was informed and when - Closure criteria and sign-off : product , SRE , and legal ( if required ) approval"
      }
    ]
